{"file_path":"/home/john/mynotes/shadow_frontier/notes/faithfulness.tex","new_string":"\\section{Does the blind spot itself constrain the profile?}\n\nYes --- the residual is not inert. The structure of\n$\\mathbb N\\subset\\Ztwo$ (terminating binary tails; finite description)\nadds three constraints beyond the four imported interfaces.\n\n\\emph{(i) Finite-seed determinism.} Letters $b_0,\\dots,b_n$ are\ndetermined by $x_0\\bmod2^{B_n+1}$; once $B_n+1>\\log_2x_0$ the class\npins $x_0$ uniquely and \\emph{every subsequent letter is forced} by\nthe $\\times3$ carry cascade, with zero remaining freedom. The free\nphase lasts only $n^*\\approx\\tfrac23\\log_2x_0$ steps (for\n$\\{1,2\\}$-words, $B_n\\approx\\tfrac32n$). Hence the whole infinite word\nhas Kolmogorov complexity $\\le\\log_2x_0+O(1)$, while repetition\nrigidity forces near-maximal \\emph{factor} complexity in banded\nwindows: the counterexample profile sharpens from ``high-complexity\ncalibrated pseudorandom word'' to \\emph{self-generated pseudorandomness\nof a fixed finite carry transducer run from a finite seed} ---\nlogarithmic description length, maximal local diversity. In\nscheduler-adversary terms: the adversary's entire budget is\n$\\log_2x_0$ bits, spent in the first two-thirds-of-$\\log_2x_0$ steps;\nafterwards it makes no choices. Measured on the survival champions:\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r|ccccc}\nn_0 & 27 & 4591 & 31911 & 517191 & 687871\\\\\n\\hline\n\\text{survival }D & 17 & 27 & 33 & 38 & 50\\\\\n\\text{forced survival} & 13 & 16 & 22 & 24 & 33\\\\\n\\text{forced fraction} & 76\\% & 59\\% & 67\\% & 63\\% & 66\\%\n\\end{array}\n\\]\nTwo-thirds of a champion's life is carry-generated, not chosen.\n\n\\emph{(ii) Countability.} The language's calibrated, shadow-biased,\nhigh-complexity word class is a Cantor continuum; integer-realizable\nwords form a \\emph{countable, computable} subfamily --- one word per\nodd integer, all emitted by the same finite-state machine\n($\\times3{+}1$ in base $2$, LSB-first, is a bounded-carry transducer).\nConcretely: of the $2^{30}$ words of depth $30$ over $\\{1,2\\}$, just\n$66$ are realized by an integer below $10^6$. Machine-style attacks\n(the LTE round chain, the $3$-smooth cascade) are therefore not\nspecial cases but the \\emph{general} case: every integer is a finite\nseed of the same automaton.\n\n\\emph{(iii) A fifth interface.} In the forced regime the letters read\nbinary digit streams of $3$-power multiples of the seed, so effective\ndigit-counting theorems (Stewart: the number of nonzero binary digits\nof $3^n$ grows effectively) become applicable imports against\nlate-time ghost alignment --- a candidate fifth archimedean interface\nbeyond clocks, counting, drift, and Baker.\n\n\\emph{Caveat.} Constraints (i)--(ii) carry no measure-theoretic\nexclusion power --- one cannot Borel--Cantelli a single computable\npoint --- which is consistent with the wall being pointwise. Their\nvalue is structural: they shrink the \\emph{profile} (what a\ncounterexample must be) from a continuum of conspiracies to the\noutput set of one finite machine, and they certify that\nautomaton-level methods address the general case.\n\n\\section*{Verdict}","old_string":"\\section*{Verdict}","replace_all":false}